    "lawCode": "Amd §898-a, Gen Bus L",
    "lawSection": "General Business Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7392\n\nSPONSOR: MYRIE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the general business law, in relation to ensuring all\nfirearm industry members are responsible for such member's unreasonable\nconduct\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo make technical fixes.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends subdivision 6 of section 898-a of the general business\nlaw by adding chapter 237 of the laws of 2021 which defines the term,\n\"qualified product\".\n\nSection 2 provides for the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nTo make technical fixes.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
