    "lawCode": "Amd §898-a, Gen Bus L",
    "lawSection": "General Business Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7392A\n\nSPONSOR: MYRIE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the general business law, in relation to the dangers to\nsafety and health and the creation of a public nuisance caused by the\nsale, manufacturing, distribution, importing, and marketing of firearms\n\n \nPURPOSE::\n\nTo make technical fixes.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS::\n\nSection 1 amends subdivision 6 of section 898-a of the general business\nlaw by adding chapter 237 of the laws of 2021 which defines the term,\n\"qualified product\".\n\nSection 2 provides for the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION::\n\nTo make technical fixes.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY::  New bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS::\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE::\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
